* {q:Signed in Blood|Signed in Blood|Signed in Blood}, part 1 of a quest chain, must be completed before {q:Tea with a Tonberry?|Tea with a Tonberry?|Tea with a Tonberry?} (Level 20+)
** Some of {n:Abelard}'s dialog changes depending on whether you've done {q:Chasing Dreams|Chasing Dreams|Chasing Dreams}.
* {q:Tea with a Tonberry?|Tea with a Tonberry?|Tea with a Tonberry?} is now available. __(verification needed)__ (Level 40+)
** Requires an {i:Attohwa Ginseng|Attohwa Ginseng|1683} from Gallinippers, Ogreflys, or Monarch Ogrefly found in {z:Attohwa Chasm} (see Windurst Path below).
* {q:Spice Gals|Spice Gals|Spice Gals} is now available. (Level 40/50+)

